                <invention-title lang="fr">GUIDE DE TIROIR ET APPAREIL DE TRAITEMENT DE LINGE LE COMPRENANT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">DRAWER GUIDE AND LAUNDRY TREATMENT APPARATUS HAVING THE SAME</invention-title>
